New sampled score: VSCO 2 Community Edition / Versilian Community Sample Library — CC0 (marimba, glockenspiel, kalimba, contrabass pizzicato, trumpet staccato). Registry and full sample-pack attributions: core/audio/INSTRUMENTS.md. Foley synthesized afresh with the explicit root material/nature sound engine. New voice: Kokoro am_adam. No original film soundtrack or frames reused as production assets.
